#: main.cpp:30
msgid "Recipients Picker Demo"
msgstr "Primatelji Birač Demo"

#: main.cpp:31
msgid "(c) 2007"
msgstr "(c) 2007"

#: mainwindow.cpp:74
msgid "Select recipient"
msgstr "Odaberi primatelja"

#: mainwindow.cpp:79 mainwindow.cpp:221
msgid "Advanced Interface"
msgstr "Unaprijedjeni interfejs"

#: mainwindow.cpp:80
msgid ""
"Toggles between a simple interface to add one or more persons as recipient "
"or an advanced interface with more possibilities which are not required so "
"often."
msgstr ""
"Prebacuje između jednostavnog interfejs za dodavanje jedne ili više osoba, "
"kao primaoca ili napredni interfejs s više mogućnosti koji nisu potrebni "
"tako često."

#: mainwindow.cpp:93
msgid "This list displays persons who are filtered with the settings above."
msgstr "Ova lista prikazuje osobe koje su filtrirani sa postavkama gore."

#: mainwindow.cpp:106
msgid "Marked persons only "
msgstr "Oznacene osobe samo "

#: mainwindow.cpp:107
msgid "Show only persons who are marked with a status"
msgstr "Samo osobe koje su označene sa statusom"

#: mainwindow.cpp:113
msgid "Search"
msgstr "Traži"

#: mainwindow.cpp:114
msgid ""
"Enter some text to filter the list of persons. You can also enter "
"information that is not visible in the list, such as addresses or phone "
"numbers."
msgstr ""
"Unesite neki tekst za filtriranje spiska osoba. Možete pristupiti "
"informacijama koje se ne vidi na listi, kao što su adrese ili brojeve "
"telefona."

#: mainwindow.cpp:119
msgid " Address book:"
msgstr " Adresar:"

#: mainwindow.cpp:124 mainwindow.cpp:245
msgid "All"
msgstr "Sve"

#: mainwindow.cpp:125 mainwindow.cpp:246
msgid "Distribution Lists"
msgstr "Distribucione liste"

#: mainwindow.cpp:126
msgid "Select a address book or a category to display those persons only."
msgstr "Odaberite adresar ili kategoriju za prikaz samo one osobe."

#: mainwindow.cpp:163
msgid "Do not show recipients' names to each other."
msgstr "Ne prikazuj primateljska imena medjusobno"

#: mainwindow.cpp:164
msgid "Display all recipients' names to each other."
msgstr "Prikazi sva  primateljska imena medjusobno"

#: mainwindow.cpp:223
msgid "Basic Interface"
msgstr "Jednostavni interfejs"

#: mainwindow.cpp:247
msgid "Category"
msgstr "Kategorija"

#: persontreeview.cpp:198
msgid ""
"You do not have any persons in your address book. You can insert persons "
"with the program kaddressbook, which is also part of the kdepim package."
msgstr ""
"Nemate nijednu osobu u vasem adresaru. Mozete unesti osobu sa programom  "
"kaddressbook, koji je takodjer dio kdepim paketa"
